TITLE Ba solution equilibration with Talc, Rhodochrosite, Sepiolite, Pb(OH)2 at 100C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ba 100
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Talc 0 10
    Rhodochrosite 0 10
    Sepiolite 0 10
    Sepiolite(d) 0 10
    Pb(OH)2 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SC_uS_cm
10 PUNCH SC
END
